# Applies only to Dockerfile.cicd (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). The legacy ./Dockerfile build keeps
# its current context. Keeps secrets, local artifacts and files the image does not need out of the CI build context.

# Secrets and per-environment configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
src/shared/config/config.ts
src/shared/config/config.ts.example

# Local artifacts
**/node_modules
dist
coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed by the image (the nest build excludes tests; docs are not served)
.git
.vscode
docs
test
**/*.spec.ts
/*.md
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.cicd
*.dockerignore
sonar-project.properties
